'''Pocket Monsters B2 W2 ~ A New Legend ~''' (Japanese: '''ポケットモンスターB2・W2 ~新たなる伝説~''') is a [[Pokémon manga]] that was serialized in [[CoroCoro|CoroCoro Comics]] starting in the June 2012 issue. The story spanned five chapters. It is written and illustrated by [[Satoshi Kanda]].

